{
  "name": "Audit stale WordPress posts and email a content refresh digest",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "3fe67bdd-9707-5e6e-8839-2d0c3cc9ef85",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -200,
        40
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 4,
        "width": 500,
        "height": 300,
        "content": "## Audit stale WordPress posts\n\nFinds published posts that have not been updated for a set number of months, counts their words, flags posts that mention older years (for example a 2021 guide), ranks them by priority, and builds an HTML digest. The digest can be emailed with Gmail.\n\n**Email is OFF by default.** Set `emailReport` to true in the Config node to send it."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "be2d80e6-bc55-5ddc-8d03-c2f0a199bdba",
      "name": "Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        320,
        40
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 5,
        "width": 520,
        "height": 320,
        "content": "## Setup\n\n1. Create a WordPress Application Password and add a **Basic Auth** credential in n8n (username + Application Password).\n2. Select it in the Get stale posts node.\n3. Edit the Config node: `siteUrl` (no trailing slash), `staleAfterMonths`, `postsToScan`, `maxRowsInReport`.\n4. Optional: add a **Gmail** credential, select it in the Gmail node, set `reportEmail` and `emailReport` = true.\n5. Run manually and read the output of Build digest.\n\nIf no posts are older than the cutoff, the workflow ends after the first request."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "599b9ccf-b481-5975-9fb8-56bd1307b98c",
      "name": "Priority rules",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        880,
        40
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 6,
        "width": 440,
        "height": 240,
        "content": "## Priority rules\n\n- **High:** not updated for 24+ months, or mentions years older than last year.\n- **Medium:** 18 to 24 months.\n- **Low:** older than your cutoff but under 18 months.\n\nYear detection is a hint only. Check each post before editing."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "3234a2c4-422e-5d3e-8ba2-83734b95f2df",
      "name": "Run manually",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "position": [
        -200,
        460
      ],
      "parameters": {},
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "b7ef5c06-1774-5a0e-9d4e-f8252c82a20b",
      "name": "First day of the month",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "position": [
        -200,
        620
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "months",
              "triggerAtHour": 9,
              "triggerAtDayOfMonth": 1
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 1.2
    },
    {
      "id": "b0b4e53d-97c8-516a-95a2-1b9b80a96ac0",
      "name": "Config",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "position": [
        40,
        540
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "02267d76-0179-557c-b299-f68d29b995ac",
              "name": "siteUrl",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "https://YOUR_SITE_URL"
            },
            {
              "id": "bef50b05-7595-5006-92b1-3f6a8f7de09f",
              "name": "staleAfterMonths",
              "type": "number",
              "value": 12
            },
            {
              "id": "e0a1803c-18a4-5393-a87b-b729c971de67",
              "name": "postsToScan",
              "type": "number",
              "value": 100
            },
            {
              "id": "320823b2-f518-5214-ae73-f7cc5936cd9c",
              "name": "maxRowsInReport",
              "type": "number",
              "value": 25
            },
            {
              "id": "850d3676-9020-5945-b908-c28dc20ce36e",
              "name": "emailReport",
              "type": "boolean",
              "value": false
            },
            {
              "id": "137d309a-44bc-5891-9d6d-3c143b6c4091",
              "name": "reportEmail",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "user@example.com"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 3.4
    },
    {
      "id": "99f8a47e-f3c6-55ea-bf9c-2b2ab4d31e3e",
      "name": "Get stale posts",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "position": [
        280,
        540
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "url": "={{ $('Config').first().json.siteUrl }}/wp-json/wp/v2/posts",
        "method": "GET",
        "options": {},
        "sendQuery": true,
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpBasicAuth",
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "status",
              "value": "publish"
            },
            {
              "name": "per_page",
              "value": "={{ $('Config').first().json.postsToScan }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "orderby",
              "value": "modified"
            },
            {
              "name": "order",
              "value": "asc"
            },
            {
              "name": "modified_before",
              "value": "={{ new Date(Date.now() - Number($('Config').first().json.staleAfterMonths) * 30 * 24 * 60 * 60 * 1000).toISOString().slice(0, 19) }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "_fields",
              "value": "id,link,title,modified,content"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 4.2
    },
    {
      "id": "83d33028-f3ab-5e17-b94c-da06f13ffd88",
      "name": "Score stale posts",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "position": [
        520,
        540
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const now = Date.now();\nconst currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();\nconst items = $input.all().filter((i) => i.json && i.json.id);\nconst scored = items.map((item) => {\n  const p = item.json;\n  const html = p.content && p.content.rendered ? p.content.rendered : '';\n  const text = html.replace(/<[^>]*>/g, ' ').replace(/\\s+/g, ' ').trim();\n  const wordCount = text ? text.split(' ').length : 0;\n  const daysSince = Math.floor((now - new Date(p.modified + 'Z').getTime()) / 86400000);\n  const years = Array.from(new Set((text.match(/\\b20[0-3]\\d\\b/g) || []).map(Number)))\n    .filter((y) => y <= currentYear - 2)\n    .sort();\n  let priority = 'Low';\n  if (daysSince >= 540) priority = 'Medium';\n  if (daysSince >= 730 || years.length > 0) priority = 'High';\n  return {\n    json: {\n      id: p.id,\n      title: p.title && p.title.rendered ? p.title.rendered : '',\n      link: p.link,\n      lastModified: String(p.modified).slice(0, 10),\n      daysSince,\n      wordCount,\n      oldYearsMentioned: years.join(', '),\n      priority,\n    },\n  };\n});\nconst rank = { High: 0, Medium: 1, Low: 2 };\nscored.sort((a, b) => rank[a.json.priority] - rank[b.json.priority] || b.json.daysSince - a.json.daysSince);\nreturn scored;\n"
      },
      "typeVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "0a611730-7307-5f08-b517-8abb153669c4",
      "name": "Build digest",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "position": [
        760,
        540
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const cfg = $('Config').first().json;\nconst all = $input.all().map((i) => i.json);\nconst rows = all.slice(0, Number(cfg.maxRowsInReport));\nconst esc = (s) => String(s == null ? '' : s).replace(/&/g, '&amp;').replace(/</g, '&lt;').replace(/>/g, '&gt;');\nconst high = all.filter((r) => r.priority === 'High').length;\nconst toRow = (r) =>\n  '<tr><td>' + esc(r.priority) + '</td><td><a href=\"' + esc(r.link) + '\">' + esc(r.title) + '</a></td><td>' +\n  esc(r.lastModified) + '</td><td>' + r.wordCount + '</td><td>' + esc(r.oldYearsMentioned) + '</td></tr>';\nconst html =\n  '<p>' + all.length + ' posts have not been updated for ' + cfg.staleAfterMonths + '+ months. High priority: ' + high +\n  '. Showing the top ' + rows.length + '.</p>' +\n  '<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tr><th>Priority</th><th>Post</th><th>Last updated</th><th>Words</th><th>Older years mentioned</th></tr>' +\n  rows.map(toRow).join('') + '</table>';\nreturn [\n  {\n    json: {\n      subject: 'WordPress content refresh digest: ' + all.length + ' stale posts (' + high + ' high priority)',\n      staleCount: all.length,\n      highPriorityCount: high,\n      hasIssues: all.length > 0,\n      html,\n    },\n  },\n];\n"
      },
      "typeVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "f20f3424-afd2-5752-a127-852b3fac3167",
      "name": "Send digest email?",
